<title>USA: Sitel sets two-for-one common stock split.</title>
<headline>Sitel sets two-for-one common stock split.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sitel Corp said on Monday that it has declared a two-for-one split of its common stock, to be effected in the form of a 100-percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable October 21 to shareholders of record on October 14. Sitel said it has about 29.3 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Sitel sells outsourced telephone-based customer service and sales programs.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
